00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.510 align:start position:0%
ukrainian soldiers fired at a drone and  helped hundreds of civilians escape as  russia directly attacked an evacuation  route near a battered bridge northwest  of kiev on sunday  a shell exploded an ear  pin the mayor said at least eight  civilians were killed  over the weekend russia and ukraine  twice attempted to open humanitarian  corridors for fleeing civilians but they  weren't implemented  ukrainian authorities released footage  showing a long line of civilians waiting  to be evacuated from mariopol after  keefe said russian shelling disrupted  plans to evacuate 200 000 people  but the russian foreign minister said  local officials were refusing to provide  an opportunity for people to leave  through the corridors  more than 1.5 million civilians left  ukraine since russia invaded in what the  united nations called the fastest  growing refugee crisis in europe since  world war  ii in hassan the only regional capital  russia captured so far  gunshots rang out as people protested  against the occupation  ukraine's defense forces released  footage showing large crowds gathered in  the central square  the news agency storyful said it  corroborated and verified these videos  which show a man climbing on top of a  russian military vehicle and waving a  ukrainian flag  negotiators from russia and ukraine are  scheduled to meet for a third round of  ceasefire talks on monday the chances  for a breakthrough are slim as moscow  shows no sign of slowing down its  invasion
 

